# (build 138e) The emulator's Mother Brain scene (docs/emulator_saves.md,
# slot 4): CONTINUE emu_mother_brain.json -- Noah's first floor at the foot
# of Mother Brain's corridor, 33,40, made by tools/emulator_scenes.py from
# walk_mother_brain.json as story.py walks it -- and up the corridor to row
# 33, where the approach (loc_70D6) sets event_flags $E00 and LevelScreen
# leaves through white (loc_634E: red up first, then green, then blue) and
# comes back from white (loc_62CC: blue down first). The same fade as
# mother_brain_white (build 138d), from a real save instead of a new game
# on the level. Passes on 138d as well: nothing under src/ changed.

start slot 1 routes/saves/emu_mother_brain.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $64 33 40
walk up 7                    # returns as the seventh step begins
wait idle                    # at rest on cell 33
wait ticks 2                 # the floor is looked at: the approach
wait ticks 3
expect pixel 4 4 $008        # black into white, red first
wait ticks 17
expect pixel 4 4 $EEE        # the 21st frame: white
wait ticks 1
expect pixel 160 112 $CEE    # the reload, from white: blue down first
wait ticks 1
expect pixel 160 112 $AEE    # blue still going down
wait idle
expect script $1813          # the confrontation
